an</span> <span begin="19.294" end="19.462">be</span> <span begin="19.462" end="19.600">a</span> <span begin="19.635" end="19.947">phan</span><span begin="20.016" end="20.328">tom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果他是幽灵 那我可以化身魅影</span></p><p begin="20.418" end="22.609" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.418" end="20.617">Hold</span><span begin="20.617" end="20.757">in&apos;</span> <span begin="20.807" end="20.935">him</span> <span begin="20.991" end="21.147">for</span> <span begin="21.147" end="21.520">ran</span><span begin="21.520" end="21.903">som,</span> <span begin="22.205" end="22.609">some</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">挟持他 索要爱情赎金</span></p><p begin="22.941" end="26.288" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.941" end="23.402">Some</span> <span begin="23.402" end="23.627">boys</span> <span begin="23.627" end="23.780">are</span> <span begin="23.780" end="23.994">try</span><span begin="23.994" end="24.159">in&apos;</span> <span begin="24.159" end="24.494">too</span> <span begin="24.494" end="24.889">hard,</span> <span begin="24.889" end="25.095">he</span> <span begin="25.095" end="25.247">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="25.247" end="25.462">try</span> <span begin="25.462" end="25.646">at</span> <span begin="25.646" end="26.021">all</span> <span begin="26.021" end="26.288">though</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些男孩太过用力 他却毫不费力</span></p><p begin="26.426" end="29.402" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.426" end="26.792">Younger</span> <span begin="26.792" end="26.948">than</span> <span begin="26.972" end="27.147">my</span> <span begin="27.147" end="27.547">exes,</span> <span begin="27.547" end="27.712">but</span> <span begin="27.732" end="27.908">he</span> <span begin="27.919" end="28.078">act</span> <span begin="28.103" end="28.238">like</span> <span begin="28.264" end="28.517">such</span> <span begin="28.517" end="28.670">a</span> <span begin="28.670" end="28.969">man,</span> <span begin="29.008" end="29.402">so</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他比我所有前任都要年轻 但却如此成熟稳重 所以</span></p><p begin="29.428" end="32.331" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.428" end="29.557">I</span> <span begin="29.557" end="29.815">see</span> <span begin="29.815" end="29.972">noth</span><span begin="29.998" end="30.159">ing</span> <span begin="30.198" end="30.423">bet</span><span begin="30.493" end="30.779">ter,</span> <span begin="30.909" end="31.046">I</span> <span begin="31.099" end="31.255">keep</span> <span begin="31.295" end="31.470">him</span> <span begin="31.470" end="31.665">for</span><span begin="31.665" end="32.020">ev</span><span begin="32.020" end="32.331">er</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我眼中再无比他更好的人 我要让他永远在我身边</span></p><p begin="32.412" end="34.720" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.412" end="32.637">Like</span> <span begin="32.637" end="32.757">a</span> <span begin="32.800" end="33.060">ven</span><span begin="33.076" end="33.421">det</span><span begin="33.500" end="33.832">ta-</span><span begin="34.299" end="34.720">ta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如宿怨般永无休止</span></p><p begin="35.025" end="38.077" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.025" end="35.329">I,</span> <span begin="35.402" end="35.684">I,</span> <span begin="35.786" end="36.020">I</span> <span begin="36.062" end="36.707">see</span> <span begin="36.707" end="36.909">how</span> <span begin="36.909" end="37.137">this</span> <span begin="37.137" end="37.290">is</span> <span begin="37.290" end="37.641">gon&apos;</span> <span begin="37.677" end="38.077">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我 我 我预见了这段感情的未来</span></p><p begin="38.757" end="40.996" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.757" end="39.174">Touch</span> <span begin="39.174" end="39.553">me</span> <span begin="39.553" end="39.711">and</span> <span begin="39.711" end="39.913">you&apos;ll</span> <sp