 <span begin="53.426" end="53.805">things</span> <span begin="53.805" end="54.123">we</span> <span begin="54.181" end="54.580">do,</span> <span begin="55.270" end="55.644">ba</span><span begin="55.644" end="56.374">by,</span> <span begin="56.762" end="57.762">mmm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你应该会看到我们的种种经历 宝贝 嗯</span></p><p begin="58.985" end="1:02.485" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.985" end="59.240">In</span> <span begin="59.240" end="59.412">the</span> <span begin="59.412" end="59.622">mid</span><span begin="59.622" end="59.799">dle</span> <span begin="59.799" end="59.996">of</span> <span begin="59.996" end="1:00.098">the</span> <span begin="1:00.144" end="1:00.780">night,</span> <span begin="1:01.073" end="1:01.247">in</span> <span begin="1:01.281" end="1:01.584">my</span> <span begin="1:01.624" end="1:02.309">drea</span><span begin="1:02.309" end="1:02.485">ms</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">午夜时分 进入我梦中</span></p><p begin="1:04.470" end="1:10.409" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.470" end="1:04.614">I</span> <span begin="1:04.666" end="1:04.860">know</span> <span begin="1:04.860" end="1:05.028">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:05.028" end="1:05.298">gonna</span> <span begin="1:05.402" end="1:05.769">be</span> <span begin="1:05.769" end="1:06.044">with</span> <span begin="1:06.133" end="1:06.433">you,</span> <span begin="1:06.433" end="1:06.906">so</span> <span begin="1:06.906" end="1:07.172">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:07.208" end="1:07.874">take</span> <span begin="1:08.041" end="1:08.675">my</span> <span begin="1:08.701" end="1:10.409">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道我终会和你在一起 所以不慌不忙</span></p><p begin="1:11.046" end="1:12.181" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.046" end="1:11.245">Are</span> <span begin="1:11.245" end="1:11.388">you</span> <span begin="1:11.388" end="1:11.710">ready</span> <span begin="1:11.710" end="1:12.007">for</spa